---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const tiers = [
  {
    number: 1,
    title: "Discovery",
    description: "From PRINT to complete games: BORDER, PAPER, INK colours, screen layout, PRINT AT positioning, character movement with INKEY$, collision detection with SCREEN$, scoring systems, enemy AI chase algorithms, lives systems, and complete game structure. Master the Spectrum's instant-on BASIC environment.",
    lessonCount: 16,
    duration: "15-25 minutes",
    status: "complete",
    url: "/sinclair-zx-spectrum/phase-0/tier-1"
  }
];
---

<Layout
  title="Phase 0: BASIC Gateway - ZX Spectrum"
  description="Learn ZX Spectrum programming in Sinclair BASIC. Master the unique colour system, rubber keyboard, and attribute-based graphics. Gateway to Z80 assembly programming."
>
  <style>
    .course-hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #333333 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: var(--space-16) var(--space-4);
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .course-hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      background-image:
        repeating-linear-gradient(
          0deg,
          transparent,
          transparent 2px,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 2px,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 4px
        );
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .course-title {
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
      text-shadow: 3px 3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .course-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      opacity: 0.95;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    }

    .course-description {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto var(--space-8);
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }

    .course-stats {
      display: flex;
      gap: var(--space-8);
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .stat-item {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stat-value {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    }

    .stat-label {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .content-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 var(--space-4);
    }

    .intro-section {
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border: 2px solid #1a1a1a;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: var(--space-8);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .intro-section h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .intro-section p {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.8;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto var(--space-4);
    }

    .tier-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: var(--space-6);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
    }

    .tier-card {
      background: var(--color-surface);
      border: 2px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: var(--space-8);
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--color-text);
      transition: all var(--transition-base);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .tier-card:hover {
      border-color: #1a1a1a;
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.15);
    }

    .tier-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-4);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    }

    .tier-number {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #333333 100%);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .tier-title-block {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .tier-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    }

    .tier-title {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .tier-description {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .tier-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding-top: var(--space-4);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }

    .tier-lessons {
      font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .tier-duration {
      opacity: 0.8;
    }

    .cta-section {
      text-align: center;
      padding: var(--space-16) 0;
    }

    .cta-title {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .cta-description {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto var(--space-6);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-8);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #333333 100%);
      color: white;
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      transition: all var(--transition-base);
    }

    .cta-button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.3);
    }

    .back-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: var(--space-2);
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .wip-notice {
      background: #fff3cd;
      border: 2px solid #ffc107;
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: var(--space-6);
      margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
      color: #856404;
    }

    .wip-notice h3 {
      color: #856404;
      margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .tier-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <!-- Course Hero -->
  <section class="course-hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1 class="course-title">PHASE 0: BASIC GATEWAY</h1>
      <p class="course-subtitle">Your Foundation for Z80 Assembly Programming</p>

      <p class="course-description">
        Learn ZX Spectrum programming in Sinclair BASIC from first principles. Master the unique attribute-based colour system,
        rubber keyboard entry, and instant-on BASIC environment. This is your gateway to Z80 assembly programming.
      </p>

      <div class="course-stats">
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-value">16</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Lessons Available</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-value">48K</div>
          <div class="stat-label">RAM</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <div class="stat-value">15-25</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Minutes Each</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Course Content -->
  <div class="content-container">
    <a href="/sinclair-zx-spectrum" class="back-link">
      ← Back to ZX Spectrum
    </a>

    <div style="background: #d4edda; border: 2px solid #28a745; border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: var(--space-6); margin-bottom: var(--space-8); color: #155724;">
      <h3 style="color: #155724; margin-bottom: var(--space-2); font-size: 1.25rem;">✅ Tier 1 Complete!</h3>
      <p>
        All 16 lessons of Tier 1: Discovery are now available. From your first PRINT statement through character movement, collision detection, scoring systems, enemy AI, and complete game development. Ready to start your ZX Spectrum journey!
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Introduction -->
    <section class="intro-section">
      <h2>What You'll Learn</h2>
      <p>
        Phase 0 teaches complete ZX Spectrum game development in Sinclair BASIC. Unlike the C64, the Spectrum boots
        straight into BASIC—no cassette loading required. Master the unique colour system where attributes control
        8×8 pixel squares, learn the rubber keyboard's keyword entry mode, and understand why the Spectrum's instant-on
        environment made it perfect for bedroom coders.
      </p>
      <p>
        Start with BORDER, PAPER, and INK commands, progress through PRINT AT for text positioning, and build toward
        complete games. By the end of Phase 0, you'll understand the Spectrum's display architecture and be ready for
        Z80 assembly programming in Phase 1.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Tier Grid -->
    <section>
      <div class="tier-grid">
        {tiers.map(tier => (
          <a href={tier.url} class="tier-card">
            <div class="tier-header">
              <div class="tier-number">{tier.number}</div>
              <div class="tier-title-block">
                <div class="tier-label">Tier {tier.number}</div>
                <h3 class="tier-title">{tier.title}</h3>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="tier-description">{tier.description}</p>
            <div class="tier-meta">
              <span class="tier-lessons">{tier.lessonCount} lesson{tier.lessonCount !== 1 ? 's' : ''}</span>
              <span class="tier-duration">{tier.duration}</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Call to Action -->
    <section class="cta-section">
      <h2 class="cta-title">Ready to Start Your Journey?</h2>
      <p class="cta-description">
        Switch on your Spectrum (or boot Fuse/ZXSpin), wait for the "© 1982 Sinclair Research Ltd" message,
        and let's write your first line of code. The rubber keyboard awaits!
      </p>
      <a href="/sinclair-zx-spectrum/phase-0/tier-1/lesson-001" class="cta-button">
        Start Lesson 1: Hello, Spectrum World →
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
